    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this wonderful two-bedroom / two-bathroom first floor apartment to the market ideally located in The Glebe Square, Newcastle, Co. Dublin. The Glebe Square couldn't be any better located right in the heart of Newcastle Village. The M50 and N7 are located close by and make commuting around Dublin and beyond hassle free. Within minutes' walk you will find a host of shops, bars and restaurants. Local schools are within walking distance and bus routes are located at the front of the development. \nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 62 sqm comprises of entrance hallway with hot press, large living room with private balcony, fully fitted kitchen with south facing balcony, two double bedrooms (one master ensuite) and main family bathroom. \nThis property is benefitted with dual aspect balconies making this home filled with tons of natural sunlight, your overlooking a green area with ample amounts of parking. \nNo. 12 Glebe Square is presented in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners with no expense spared when upgrading in recent years, it comes to the market as a blank canvas with no onward chain making it perfect for any first-time buyer looking to get on the property ladder, anyone looking to downsize or any keen investor looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area. It boasts a long list of additional features to include electric heating, spacious living, ample storage & top-quality fixtures & fittings to name but a few. \nEarly viewing is highly advised, call Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing!! \nAdditional Features; \n- c. 62 sqm \n- 2 BED / 2 BATH \n- MGMT fee c. 1,450 per annum \n- Apartment \n- Located on the first floor \n- Great condition throughout \n- Blank canvas \n- No onward chain \n- Extra spacious living \n- Tastefully decorated from top to bottom \n- Entrance hallway with hot press\n- Living room with balcony \n- Fully fitted kitchen with south facing balcony \n- Open plan living/dining/kitchen \n- Two double bedrooms \n- Master ensuite \n- Built in wardrobes \n- Main family bathroom \n- Dual aspect balconies \n- Top quality fixtures & fittings \n- Double glazed windows \n- Top quality blinds \n- Peaceful area\n- Located right in the heart of the Village \n- Ample parking \n- Within seconds of Newcastle Main street \n- Within easy reach M50 Motorway \n- Primary and secondary schools in close proximity \n- Ideal for first time buyers \n- Viewing highly advised! \nDirections: D22 PY77\n"
      },
      {
